    dznorm:expressedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/law/2008-11-15/08-19#art_90_15> .

<https://legal.dz/resource/law/2008-11-15/08-19#art_90_15_condition_0_6bd26193_activity_908f8160a2> a dznorm:Activity ;
